.TH CRS\-GUI 1 "2026-06-12" "Mu2e DAQ" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
crs\-gui \- Mu2e control room manager (tunnels and service discovery)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B crs\-gui
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A PyQt6 application with two tabs.
.SS Tunnels tab
One row per configured VNC session showing tunnel state (probed via the
ssh control socket every 15 seconds) with
.BR Open ,
.BR Close ,
and
.B Connect
buttons.
Connect opens the tunnel when needed and launches
.B vncviewer \-Shared
on the session's local port.
All ssh operations run in worker threads; the UI never blocks.
.SS Discovery tab
Sends a mu2edaq\-discovery DISCOVER query and lists every responding
service: name, application type, host, port, start time, PID, and
instance id.
Two scan modes:
.TP
.B Via gateway (production)
Runs
.B mu2edaq\-discover \-\-json
on a selected cluster node over ssh and parses the result.
This is the default, since multicast does not traverse the FNAL
gateway.
.TP
.B Local multicast
Queries the local network segment directly (useful on-site or for
development).
.PP
Double-clicking a VNC row opens the matching session tunnel and
attaches the viewer.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " FILE"
Path to controlroom.yaml.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR crs\-tunnel (1),
.BR crs\-remote (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-discover (1)
.SH REPOSITORY
.UR https://github.com/Mu2e/mu2edaq-controlroom-setup
https://github.com/Mu2e/mu2edaq-controlroom-setup
.UE
